.venv/
cache/
pairs/
report/
# ...but keep the measured NUMBERS in version control (private repo only):
# results are the record. Imagery stays out - donated frames are never
# committed to any repository, public or private, and judgement sheets carry
# the author's own photographs.
!report/
report/**
!report/**/
!report/**/*.json
!report/**/*.md
!report/**/*.csv
# The per-frame catalogue indexes the author's personal photographs by absolute
# path and describes their content (91 notes name a baby or nudity). The
# aggregate reports carry the findings; the index itself never enters git.
report/catalogue.json
report/catalogue.csv
report/labeling/
out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
._*
*.egg-info/
pairs_jxl/
release/
